<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:cf="using:Cornflower.Controls"
                    xmlns:wp81="using:Cornflower.Themes.Wp81">
  <!--
    The Windows Phone 8.1 ListView and ListViewItem, on Avalonia's ListBox and ListBoxItem: the default styles of the
    8.1 Update 1 runtime (listview.json and listviewitem.json, which equal the SDK's generic.xaml), re-expressed as
    Avalonia ControlThemes. Every value is the phone's resource key, by DynamicResource, so it follows the theme
    variant and an app can override it by its key, but for the check mode's two offsets (below).
    docs/controls/ListView/PLAN.md has the values and their sources.

    The ListView's look is the ListBox's own: the list 8.1 apps write is a ListView, and the phone's ListBox, kept for
    8.0's apps, is a later tier's, which can take a key of its own.

    ListView: the phone's Border round a ScrollViewer round an ItemsPresenter. The ScrollViewer is a plain one, the
    phone's with its thin indicators (Controls/ScrollViewer.axaml), named as Avalonia's ListBox looks for it, its
    values bound from the ListBox's attached ScrollViewer values as the phone's are (docs/controls/ScrollViewer,
    "How a later control holds it"). The phone's ItemsStackPanel is Avalonia's VirtualizingStackPanel.

    ListViewItem, part for part, with Avalonia's PART_ContentPresenter for the phone's contentPresenter:
    - OuterContainer, untilted; ReorderHintContent, its Grid, with a transparent background, takes the hits across
      the item, so a press at its very edge still selects (as the Button's Root).
    - CheckboxTiltContainer, at the top left inside ListViewItemMultiselectCheckBoxMargin, holds the check box: a
      25.5 Rectangle in CheckBox's brushes and the tick (Wp81.Glyph.CheckMark at its own size, as CheckBox's), in
      CheckboxContainer, which sits 40.5 to the left, clipped away by CheckboxOuterContainer's 25.5 square, until the
      list is in the check mode.
    - ContentContainer and TiltContainer, the part the phone's PointerDownThemeAnimation targets, so it is marked
      Tilt.IsTarget: the whole content tilts, the check box doesn't; ContentBorder draws the item's Background,
      BorderBrush and BorderThickness, and slides 40.5 to the right in the check mode.
    - SelectedBorder and SelectedCheckMark, at nought opacity: a ListView item never shows them (only GridMultiSelect,
      a GridView's state, does), but they make an item at least 2.5 + 34 + 2.5 tall, 39.17 once laid out at 2.4,
      as the phone's are. So the earmark and its tick, which draw only in GridMultiSelect, are left out: they are
      GridViewItem's.
    - Left out: the placeholder TextBlock and Rectangle (DataPlaceholder: Avalonia has no data virtualisation), the
      ScaleTransform and the reorder states (reorder is deferred).

    The visual states: Pressed (Avalonia's :pressed, at once on a press, as the phone's) runs the tilt on
    TiltContainer; in the check mode, CheckboxPressed fills the box with the accent and draws the tick over it, and
    the tilt runs on the check box instead. Disabled dims the content to ListViewItemDisabledThemeOpacity (the 8.1
    Update 1 runtime's 0.4) and the box and tick to their disabled brushes. Selected (:selected) shows the tick, which
    shows only in the check mode. ListMultiSelect is wp81:PhoneListMultiSelect.IsOn, which the ListView theme sets
    on a list whose SelectionMode has Multiple (with Toggle, WinRT's Multiple; without, its Extended, whose selection
    would otherwise draw nothing), and its items inherit: the box comes in and the content goes over, both over
    the phone's 0.15 s, linear. Its two offsets are ListViewItemContentOffsetX (-40.5) and
    ListViewItemContentTranslateX (40.5), written here as literals: a transform transition takes a TransformOperations,
    which a resource double can't make. PointerOver, focus and SelectedUnfocused change nothing; FocusAdorner is
    cleared.
  -->

  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type ListBox}" TargetType="ListBox">
    <Setter Property="IsTabStop" Value="False" />
    <Setter Property="KeyboardNavigation.TabNavigation" Value="Once" />
    <Setter Property="ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility" Value="Disabled" />
    <Setter Property="ScrollViewer.VerticalScrollBarVisibility" Value="Auto" />
    <Setter Property="ScrollViewer.IsDeferredScrollingEnabled" Value="False" />
    <Setter Property="ScrollViewer.BringIntoViewOnFocusChange" Value="True" />
    <!-- Not set by the phone's style: what its ListView inherits from the page. -->
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource PhoneForegroundBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="FocusAdorner" Value="{x:Null}" />
    <!-- Out of the check mode, unless the style below says so: set, not inherited, so a list in an item of a list in the
         check mode has its own. -->
    <Setter Property="wp81:PhoneListMultiSelect.IsOn" Value="False" />
    <Setter Property="ItemsPanel">
      <ItemsPanelTemplate>
        <VirtualizingStackPanel />
      </ItemsPanelTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Border BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}">
          <ScrollViewer x:Name="PART_ScrollViewer"
                        HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="{TemplateBinding (ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility)}"
                        VerticalScrollBarVisibility="{TemplateBinding (ScrollViewer.VerticalScrollBarVisibility)}"
                        IsScrollChainingEnabled="{TemplateBinding (ScrollViewer.IsScrollChainingEnabled)}"
                        IsDeferredScrollingEnabled="{TemplateBinding (ScrollViewer.IsDeferredScrollingEnabled)}"
                        BringIntoViewOnFocusChange="{TemplateBinding (ScrollViewer.BringIntoViewOnFocusChange)}"
                        AllowAutoHide="{TemplateBinding (ScrollViewer.AllowAutoHide)}"
                        IsScrollInertiaEnabled="{TemplateBinding (ScrollViewer.IsScrollInertiaEnabled)}"
                        HorizontalSnapPointsType="{TemplateBinding (ScrollViewer.HorizontalSnapPointsType)}"
                        VerticalSnapPointsType="{TemplateBinding (ScrollViewer.VerticalSnapPointsType)}">
            <ItemsPresenter x:Name="PART_ItemsPresenter"
                            ItemsPanel="{TemplateBinding ItemsPanel}"
                            Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                            HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                            VerticalAlignment="Top" />
          </ScrollViewer>
        </Border>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>

    <!--
      The check mode: any SelectionMode with Multiple (1), alone or with Toggle (2) and AlwaysSelected (4), by value, as a
      selector's comma can't sit in a flags value. Its items inherit it.
    -->
    <Style Selector="^[SelectionMode=1], ^[SelectionMode=3], ^[SelectionMode=5], ^[SelectionMode=7]">
      <Setter Property="wp81:PhoneListMultiSelect.IsOn" Value="True" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type ListBoxItem}" TargetType="ListBoxItem">
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{DynamicResource ContentControlThemeFontFamily}" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource ControlContentThemeFontSize}" />
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="KeyboardNavigation.TabNavigation" Value="Local" />
    <Setter Property="Margin" Value="{DynamicResource ListViewItemMargin}" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Left" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Top" />
    <Setter Property="FocusAdorner" Value="{x:Null}" />
    <!-- Not set by the phone's style: WinRT's own default, which Avalonia's ContentControl's is not. The tilted content
         draws past the item's edges, as the phone's does, and the check box's own clip hides it at rest. -->
    <Setter Property="ClipToBounds" Value="False" />
    <Setter Property="cf:Tilt.IsEnabled" Value="True" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Border x:Name="OuterContainer">
          <Grid x:Name="ReorderHintContent" Background="Transparent">
            <Border x:Name="CheckboxTiltContainer"
                    HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                    VerticalAlignment="Top"
                    Margin="{DynamicResource ListViewItemMultiselectCheckBoxMargin}">
              <Border x:Name="CheckboxOuterContainer">
                <Border.Clip>
                  <RectangleGeometry Rect="0,0,25.5,25.5" />
                </Border.Clip>
                <Grid x:Name="CheckboxContainer" RenderTransform="translateX(-40.5px)">
                  <Grid.Transitions>
                    <Transitions>
                      <TransformOperationsTransition Property="RenderTransform" Duration="0:0:0.15" />
                    </Transitions>
                  </Grid.Transitions>
                  <Rectangle x:Name="NormalRectangle"
                             Width="25.5"
                             Height="25.5"
                             Fill="{DynamicResource CheckBoxBackgroundThemeBrush}"
                             Stroke="{DynamicResource CheckBoxBorderThemeBrush}"
                             StrokeThickness="{DynamicResource CheckBoxBorderThemeThickness}" />
                  <Path x:Name="CheckGlyph"
                        IsHitTestVisible="False"
                        Opacity="0"
                        HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                        VerticalAlignment="Center"
                        Fill="{DynamicResource CheckBoxForegroundThemeBrush}"
                        Data="{DynamicResource Wp81.Glyph.CheckMark}" />
                </Grid>
              </Border>
            </Border>
            <Border x:Name="ContentContainer">
              <Border x:Name="TiltContainer" cf:Tilt.IsTarget="True">
                <Border x:Name="ContentBorder"
                        Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                        BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                        BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
                        RenderTransform="none">
                  <Border.Transitions>
                    <Transitions>
                      <TransformOperationsTransition Property="RenderTransform" Duration="0:0:0.15" />
                    </Transitions>
                  </Border.Transitions>
                  <ContentPresenter x:Name="PART_ContentPresenter"
                                    Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                                    HorizontalAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}"
                                    VerticalAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}"
                                    Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                                    ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding ContentTemplate}"
                                    wp81:PhoneHeaderLine.IsEnabled="True" />
                </Border>
              </Border>
            </Border>
            <Border x:Name="SelectedBorder"
                    IsHitTestVisible="False"
                    Opacity="0"
                    BorderBrush="{DynamicResource ListViewItemSelectedBackgroundThemeBrush}"
                    BorderThickness="{DynamicResource GridViewItemMultiselectBorderThickness}">
              <Panel x:Name="SelectedCheckMark"
                     Width="34"
                     Height="34"
                     HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                     VerticalAlignment="Top" />
            </Border>
          </Grid>
        </Border>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>

    <Style Selector="^:selected /template/ Path#CheckGlyph">
      <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="1" />
    </Style>

    <!-- ListMultiSelect: the box comes in, the content goes over, and a press tilts the box (CheckboxPressed). -->
    <Style Selector="^[(wp81|PhoneListMultiSelect.IsOn)=True]">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Grid#CheckboxContainer">
        <Setter Property="RenderTransform" Value="translateX(0px)" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#ContentBorder">
        <Setter Property="RenderTransform" Value="translateX(40.5px)" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#CheckboxTiltContainer">
        <Setter Property="cf:Tilt.IsTarget" Value="True" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#TiltContainer">
        <Setter Property="cf:Tilt.IsTarget" Value="False" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^:pressed /template/ Rectangle#NormalRectangle">
        <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource CheckBoxPressedBackgroundThemeBrush}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^:pressed /template/ Path#CheckGlyph">
        <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource CheckBoxPressedForegroundThemeBrush}" />
      </Style>
    </Style>

    <Style Selector="^:disabled">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
        <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="{DynamicResource ListViewItemDisabledThemeOpacity}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Rectangle#NormalRectangle">
        <Setter Property="Stroke" Value="{DynamicResource CheckBoxDisabledBorderThemeBrush}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Path#CheckGlyph">
        <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource CheckBoxDisabledForegroundThemeBrush}" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>
</ResourceDictionary>
